---
description: Ensure all new features follow the feature-driven directory structure.
globs: ["lib/features/**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- All new features must be created inside a dedicated directory under `lib/features/`.
- Each feature directory must contain three subdirectories: `data`, `domain`, and `presentation`.
- UI-related code (Widgets, BLoCs) must go into `presentation`.
- Business logic and abstract repositories must go into `domain`.
- Data fetching and repository implementations must go into `data`.
- Do not create top-level directories like `lib/blocs`, `lib/models`, or `lib/repositories`. Place these files inside the relevant feature's layered structure.

